sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant KQ as Kueue
    participant KR as KubeRay
    participant Head as Head Pod
    participant Sub as Submitter
    participant W as Workers

    Dev->>KQ: kubectl apply RayJob
    Note over KQ: quota check

    alt quota available
        KQ->>KR: unsuspend
        KR->>Head: create head + Service
        KR->>W: create worker pods
        W->>Head: register :6379
        KR->>Sub: create submitter
        Sub->>Head: ray job submit :8265
        Head->>W: dispatch tasks
        W-->>Head: return results
        Head-->>Sub: SUCCEEDED
        KR->>Head: delete cluster
        KR->>Sub: delete submitter
        KQ->>KQ: release quota
    else quota full
        Note over KQ: hold — 0 pods
    end
